# Free API Keys for Hybrid Mode (Optional - system works without them)

# ✅ WORKING WITHOUT KEYS:
# - OpenSky Network (flights): FREE, no key needed - LIVE DATA! 
# - Railway MCP (trains): FREE, no key needed - LIVE DATA!
# - Regional bus APIs: FREE, limited coverage

# 🚀 OPTIONAL ENHANCEMENTS:
# VariFlight Aviation MCP (100 free calls per key)
# Get free key at: https://mcp.variflight.com/
VARIFLIGHT_KEY=your_variflight_key_here

# Google Flights via SerpAPI (100 free searches/month)
# Get free key at: https://serpapi.com/
SERPAPI_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here

# Aviationstack Flight API (1000 free requests/month)  
# Get free key at: https://aviationstack.com/
AVIATIONSTACK_KEY=your_aviationstack_key_here

# Railway API (Optional - some endpoints are free)
# Check: https://railwayapi.com/
RAILWAY_API_KEY=your_railway_api_key_here

# LLM API Keys (Optional - for AI-powered planning)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key_here
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key_here

# 🎉 CURRENT STATUS:
# ✅ Flights: REAL DATA from OpenSky Network (no key needed)
# ✅ Trains: REAL DATA from Railway MCP (no key needed)  
# ✅ Buses: Regional real data + demo fallback
# ✅ All modes: Intelligent fallbacks to realistic demo data
